 "_doc": "Tswelopele Local Municipality (Bultfontein) Emunsoft 'TAX INVOICE/STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT' (same print family as Ray Nkonyeni): masthead with the municipality's own VAT No.:4000846487, header block, METER READINGS table (one meter with several ELECTRICITY kWh registers and several KVA registers, plus a WATER meter), ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger, VAT line, aging strip. Electricity is ELECFLEX time-of-use, identified by ledger code <nn>TOU<band>: P peak, S standard, F off-peak (kWh x rate), D demand charge kVA, A network access charge kVA, B kVA basic charge. Values ex VAT. total_ex_vat_r = sum of all TOU-coded lines; peak/standard/offpeak kWh and Rands from P/S/F, demand_kva/demand_r from D, other_r = A + B. total_kwh = the meter table's ELECTRICITY registers' consumption summed (independent of the ledger; equals P+S+F units on 11/11). Readings left blank (three registers on one meter); read_end = the register reading date. Fingerprint: VAT 4000846487 + 'TSWELOPELE'. IDENTITY tsw_ident_ex = closing balance - opening balance - every non-TOU ledger line (payments, refuse, sewer, water, VAT): 0.00 on 11/11. Checked on 11 bills.",
